# Alidu Anthony — Portfolio: Full Technical Breakdown

---

## 1. Project Overview

This is a **full-stack personal portfolio website** for Alidu Anthony. It has evolved through two generations:

| Generation | Stack | Location |
|---|---|---|
| **V1 (Static)** | HTML / Vanilla CSS / Vanilla JS | Root directory (`index.html`, `style.css`, `script.js`) |
| **V2 (React App)** | React 18 / TailwindCSS / Framer Motion + Node.js Express Backend | `frontend/` + `backend/` |

The **V2 React app** is what is live and deployed on **Vercel**. The static V1 files remain in the root but are no longer the primary app.

