## 3. Frontend (V2 React App)

### Tech Stack
| Package | Version | Purpose |
|---|---|---|
| `react` | 18.2.0 | Core UI framework |
| `framer-motion` | 12.29.2 | Animations & scroll effects |
| `@react-three/fiber` | 8.x | 3D WebGL rendering |
| `@react-three/drei` | 9.x | 3D scene helpers |
| `three` | 0.164.1 | WebGL 3D engine |
| `axios` | 1.4.0 | HTTP client for API calls |
| `lucide-react` | 0.563.0 | Icon library |
| `tailwindcss` | 3.3.2 | Utility CSS framework |
| `@vercel/analytics` | 1.6.1 | Vercel analytics tracking |

### App Layout (App.js)
The root component assembles the full page in this order:
1. CustomCursor — custom animated mouse cursor
2. Scroll progress bar (Framer Motion useScroll)
3. GridBackground — animated background grid
4. Header
5. Hero
6. PersonaSection
7. About
8. Skills
9. Projects
10. Blog
11. Contact
12. Footer
13. Corner watermarks: "Engineering_Profile / V2.0" and "Optimized_for_Production"

### Components (detailed)

#### Header.js
- Fixed top navbar with scroll detection (backdrop blur kicks in after 20px scroll)
- Dark/Light theme toggle — persisted in localStorage, applied via data-theme attribute on <html>
- Nav links: About, Skills, Projects, Blog, Contact
- Mobile side-panel menu with AnimatePresence slide-in animation
- Social links in mobile menu: GitHub, X (Twitter), Instagram

#### Hero.js
- Typing effect cycling through: ["Software Engineer", "Systems Architect", "Java Specialist", "UI/UX Artisan"]
- Two CTAs: "View Work" → #projects, "Start Session" → #contact
- Download CV button → fetches Anthony_Alidu_CV.pdf from public/ via process.env.PUBLIC_URL
- Terminal-aesthetic decorations: Core_Temp, Uptime, Thread_Load labels
- Geographic coordinates watermark: LAT: 9.0765° N // LONG: 7.3986° E

#### Contact.js
- Form fields: name, email, message
- Primary send: POST https://api.web3forms.com/submit with access_key from REACT_APP_WEB3FORMS_KEY
  - Subject auto-set to: "New Collaboration Inquiry from {name}"
- Secondary sync (optional): After Web3Forms success, POST {REACT_APP_API_URL}/api/contact to save to PostgreSQL
  - This silently fails if the backend is offline (non-blocking)
- Contact info displayed: tonyalidu@gmail.com, GitHub, X (@AliduTony), Location (Abuja, Nigeria)

#### Blog.js
- Fetches blog posts from the backend which proxies the Google Blogger API v3

#### Projects.js
- Fetches all projects from GET /api/projects

#### Skills.js
- Largest component (20KB) — rich animated skill showcase

#### PersonaSection.js
- A persona/identity section (unique to V2, not in V1)

#### AnimatedBackground3D.js
- Three.js 3D animated background scene

#### CustomCursor.js
- Replaces the default OS cursor with a custom animated element

#### GridBackground.js
- CSS/canvas grid overlay for the background

