## 4. Backend (Express.js API)

### Tech Stack
| Package | Purpose |
|---|---|
| `express` | HTTP server framework |
| `cors` | Cross-origin resource sharing |
| `helmet` | HTTP security headers |
| `express-rate-limit` | Rate limiting (100 req / 15 min per IP) |
| `bcryptjs` | Password hashing |
| `jsonwebtoken` | JWT auth (access + refresh tokens) |
| `pg` | PostgreSQL client |
| `zod` | Schema validation |
| `swagger-ui-express` | API documentation UI |
| `@asteasolutions/zod-to-openapi` | Auto-generates OpenAPI spec from Zod schemas |
| `multer` | File upload handling |

### Server Configuration (server.js)
- Runs on port 3001 (default)
- CORS restricted to FRONTEND_URL env var
- Rate limit: 100 requests per 15 minutes per IP
- Body size limit: 10MB
- Swagger UI served at: GET /api-docs

