## 5. All API Endpoints

### System
| Method | Path | Auth | Description |
|---|---|---|---|
| GET | / | None | Health check — returns "Portfolio API is running" |
| GET | /api/health | None | Returns { status: 'OK', timestamp } |
| GET | /api-docs | None | Interactive Swagger UI documentation |

---

### Auth — /api/auth
| Method | Path | Auth | Description |
|---|---|---|---|
| POST | /api/auth/login | None | Login with email + password. Returns accessToken, refreshToken, user |
| POST | /api/auth/refresh | None | Swap a refresh token for a new access + refresh token pair |
| POST | /api/auth/logout | Bearer JWT | Clears stored refresh token in DB |
| GET | /api/auth/me | Bearer JWT | Returns current authenticated user profile |

JWT Details:
- Access Token: Expires in 15m (signed with JWT_SECRET)
- Refresh Token: Expires in 7d (signed with JWT_REFRESH_SECRET)
- Tokens use rotating refresh strategy (new refresh token issued on each /refresh call)

---

### Projects — /api/projects
| Method | Path | Auth | Description |
|---|---|---|---|
| GET | /api/projects | None | Get all projects (public) |
| GET | /api/projects/:id | None | Get single project by ID (public) |
| POST | /api/projects | Admin JWT | Create new project |
| PUT | /api/projects/:id | Admin JWT | Update project |
| DELETE | /api/projects/:id | Admin JWT | Delete project |

Project Schema:
  title: string (1–100 chars)
  description: string (10–1000 chars)
  technologies: array of strings
  githubUrl: URL (optional)
  liveUrl: URL (optional)
  imageUrl: URL (optional)

---

### Blog — /api/blog
| Method | Path | Auth | Description |
|---|---|---|---|
| GET | /api/blog | None | Fetches published posts from Google Blogger API v3 |
| GET | /api/blog/:id | None | Get single published post by ID (from DB) |
| GET | /api/blog/admin/all | Admin JWT | Get ALL posts including drafts |
| GET | /api/blog/admin/:id | Admin JWT | Get any post by ID including drafts |
| POST | /api/blog | Admin JWT | Create new blog post (saves to DB) |
| PUT | /api/blog/:id | Admin JWT | Update blog post |
| DELETE | /api/blog/:id | Admin JWT | Delete blog post |

NOTE: The public GET /api/blog route proxies Google Blogger API (not local DB).
HTML is stripped from post content; first 300 chars used as excerpt.

---

### Contact — /api/contact
| Method | Path | Auth | Description |
|---|---|---|---|
| POST | /api/contact | None | Submit a contact form message (saves to DB if available) |
| GET | /api/contact | Admin JWT | Get all contact submissions |
| PATCH | /api/contact/:id/read | Admin JWT | Mark a contact message as read |
| DELETE | /api/contact/:id | Admin JWT | Delete a contact message |

Dual-path contact: Frontend sends via Web3Forms first (email delivery).
On success, it also POSTs to this endpoint to persist in DB.
If DB is offline, the backend returns 201 anyway.

---

### Users — /api/users
| Method | Path | Auth | Description |
|---|---|---|---|
| GET | /api/users | Admin JWT | Get all users |
| GET | /api/users/:id | Admin JWT | Get user by ID |
| POST | /api/users | Admin JWT | Create new user (bcrypt hashed, salt=10) |
| PUT | /api/users/:id | Admin JWT | Update user (username, email, role) |
| DELETE | /api/users/:id | Admin JWT | Delete user (cannot delete yourself) |

